<% content_for :title, "隱私權政策 / Privacy policy · Household Tracker" %>
<article class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl space-y-8 py-8 leading-relaxed">
  <header class="space-y-1">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">隱私權政策 / Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">最後更新 / Last updated: 2026-10-18</p>
  </header>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">中文</h2>
    <p>Household Tracker 是一個私人的家庭記帳應用程式，只供受邀的家庭成員使用，不對外開放，也沒有廣告。</p>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
      <li><strong>收集的資料：</strong>你的姓名、電子郵件、（使用 Google 登入時）Google 帳號 ID；你和家人輸入的帳單、金額、日期、備註與收據照片（上傳時會移除 GPS 等中繼資料）；接收推播通知的裝置訂閱資訊；以及錯誤報告（不含個人資料）。</li>
      <li><strong>用途：</strong>只用於登入、讓同一家庭的成員查看資料，以及透過電子郵件和推播寄送提醒。</li>
      <li><strong>Google 資料：</strong>Google 登入只取得你的姓名和電子郵件。寄送提醒信使用本應用程式自己的寄件帳號，不會讀取任何人的信件。本應用程式對 Google API 資料的使用遵守 Google API 服務使用者資料政策，包括「有限使用」規定。</li>
      <li><strong>分享：</strong>不出售、不出租，也不與第三方分享。資料存放在 Railway（主機）；錯誤報告存放在 Sentry。</li>
      <li><strong>刪除：</strong>你可以請邀請你的家庭擁有者刪除你的帳號與資料。刪除後，備份會在 4 週內自動過期。</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-2">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold">English</h2>
    <p>Household Tracker is a private household-bills app for invited family members only. It is not open to the public and shows no ads.</p>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6">
      <li><strong>What we collect:</strong> your name, email address and, if you use Google sign-in, your Google account ID; the bills, amounts, dates, notes and receipt photos you and your family enter (GPS and other metadata are removed on upload); the push subscription of devices that receive notifications; and error reports (without personal data).</li>
      <li><strong>How it is used:</strong> only to sign you in, show your household's data to its members, and send reminders by email and push notification.</li>
      <li><strong>Google user data:</strong> Google sign-in only receives your name and email address. Reminder emails are sent from the app's own sender account; the app never reads anyone's mail. The app's use of information received from Google APIs adheres to the Google API Services User Data Policy, including the Limited Use requirements.</li>
      <li><strong>Sharing:</strong> nothing is sold, rented or shared with third parties. Data is hosted on Railway; error reports are stored on Sentry.</li>
      <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> ask the household owner who invited you to delete your account and data. Backups expire within 4 weeks after deletion.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <p><%= link_to "← Household Tracker", root_path, class: "text-blue-700 underline" %></p>
</article>
